[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2474450232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99152#issuecomment-2474450232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99152","id":2474450232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TfR04","user":{"login":"AdamLearns","id":60950402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTUwNDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60950402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamLearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-13T18:41:58Z","updated_at":"2024-11-13T18:41:58Z","body":"Note to anyone experiencing this: you can work around this by setting `NodeWithReference` through code instead of through the editor. This isn't ideal as it means that you can't just start using the nodes from `_Ready()`, but at least it's a somewhat minimal change as opposed to redoing your entire scene inheritance hierarchy.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2474450232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524563814","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99152#issuecomment-2524563814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99152","id":2524563814,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Weclm","user":{"login":"M4rYu5","id":30922014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTIyMDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30922014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5","html_url":"https://github.com/M4rYu5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rYu5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T22:58:48Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T22:58:48Z","body":"In MRP, the `derived.tscn` file contains a line that removes the base script: `script = null.`\n\nIt seems that Godot treats scripts like components. By changing or removing a script in derived scene, the base script will be completely gone (disposed), even if it's an extension of the base script.\n\nI've seen same behavior with:\n```GDScript\nclass_name MyClass\n\nextends Node\n```\neven if you expect `MyClass` to be a new (self contained) element, it's actually a `Node` with added functionality.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2524563814/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842979126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99152#issuecomment-2842979126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99152","id":2842979126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pdGs2","user":{"login":"AdamLearns","id":60950402,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwOTUwNDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60950402?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns","html_url":"https://github.com/AdamLearns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdamLearns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-30T18:51:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-30T18:51:51Z","body":"Update: I believe that the bug only occurs when the referenced node _is_ the root node of the scene. This wasn't obvious to me at first. In other words, the original repro had this:\n\n- `CanvasGroup Base`\n  - `Node NodeReferencer` (which points to `Base`)\n\n...but the issue won't repro if you change the scene hierarchy so that `Base` is no longer the root node:\n\n- `Node NewNodeAtRoot`\n  - `CanvasGroup Base`\n    - `Node NodeReferencer` (which points to `Base`)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2842979126/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4412034137","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99152#issuecomment-4412034137","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99152","id":4412034137,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBvpMWQ","user":{"login":"NewfolderGames","id":23236291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjM2Mjkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23236291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames","html_url":"https://github.com/NewfolderGames","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NewfolderGames/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-09T08:25:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-09T08:26:29Z","body":"Hi, late to the party, but I am having the same issue mentioned above.\n\nI have two scenes, `unit.tscn` and `unit_player.tscn`(inherited from `unit.tscn`). Both have CharacterBody2D as root nodes, but have different script attached to them. `unit.tscn` has `Unit.cs` script and `unit_player.tscn` has `PlayerUnit.cs`(inherited from `Unit.cs`).\n\n```\nunit.tscn\nUnit\n|- ...\n|- CollisionRoot\n   |- BodyCollision\n   |- WeaponCollision\n|- ...\n```\n\n```\nunit_player.tscn\nUnit_Player\n|- ...\n|- CollisionRoot\n   |- BodyCollision\n   |- WeaponCollision\n|- ...\n```\n\nBoth `BodyCollision` and `WeaponCollision` nodes have scripts that references the root node by `../..` path in the editor.\n\n`unit.tscn` runs fine, but when `unit_player.tscn` scene spawns, both `BodyCollision` and `WeaponCollision` lose the reference to the root node.\n\nI have noticed that `Base.Dispose` is called for `unit_player.tscn`.\n\nHere is reproduceable project.\n\nhttps://github.com/NewfolderGames/kaleidoscope/releases/tag/issue-report-1\n\n> Edit: The project is on 4.7-beta-1.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4412034137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4438321596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99152#issuecomment-4438321596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99152","id":4438321596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCItpvA","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-13T07:14:59Z","updated_at":"2026-05-13T07:14:59Z","body":"- Closing as a duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86970.\n- Should be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118822.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4438321596/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]